rule day_the_zone_never_ships_on v1
description "A date an applied table writes, named day by day with the zone it is decided from: the third row asks for a local order on 3 July, the day only a national order ships"

enum zone = local | national
enum timing = early | late | odd

inputs
  zone : zone

apply s = "shared/ship_day.rule" meaning:ba324522b221da9e
  zone = zone
  ships -> s_ships

outputs
  x : timing

table pick
| zone     | s_ships    | -> x  |
| local    | 2026-07-01 | early |
| national | 2026-07-03 | late  |
| local    | 2026-07-03 | odd   |
